    "body": "Fixes #7073.\n\nMake `sys.getsizeof()` include the shape/stride allocation and the data buffer allocated by `cython.view.array`. Buffers supplied by callers are excluded, including when a custom deallocation callback is present, because their ownership and allocation size are not known.\n\nTests: existing array tests and new ownership/size tests with C and C++ backends on x86-64 and aarch64 (42 passed on each); shared utility mode on x86-64 (14 passed).\n\nAI assistance: OpenAI Codex assisted with the implementation and tests.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8116#discussion_r4476794560"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/8116"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/comments/4476794560"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "In the case of test failures, the output of this is an unhelpful `False`. The following would improve it:\n```suggestion\n    size_difference = sys.getsizeof(large) - sys.getsizeof(small)\n    assert size_difference == 1023 * sizeof(int), size_difference / sizeof(int)\n```\nThe same applies to all other tests.",
            "commit_id": "d7f0f5a87ffb075e45b2410235ace81bffd31be1",
            "copilot_code_review_sources": [],
            "created_at": "2026-11-05T05:04:27Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@\n+# mode: run\n+\n+import sys\n+from cython.view cimport array\n+from libc.stdlib cimport malloc, free\n+\n+def allocated_data_size():\n+    \"\"\"\n+    >>> allocated_data_size()\n+    True\n+    \"\"\"\n+    cdef array small = array((1,), sizeof(int), 'i')\n+    cdef array large = array((1024,), sizeof(int), 'i')\n+    return sys.getsizeof(large) - sys.getsizeof(small) == 1023 * sizeof(int)",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8116#discussion_r4476794560",
